{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693350/extras/b66714a9ec12adbd3a850cc66bedd20c.avif?t=1770888744\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693350/extras_big/b66714a9ec12adbd3a850cc66bedd20c.avif?t=1770888744 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore 8 Unique Worlds:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 8 wildly different environments throughout the solar system in search of your ex-girlfriend, Kat. Revisit them with better equipment to uncover things you might've missed before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693350/extras/c40dd9a7f635a3b8dd2e85e6df3da98e.avif?t=1770888744\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693350/extras_big/c40dd9a7f635a3b8dd2e85e6df3da98e.avif?t=1770888744 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Weapons &amp; Equipment:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you fulfill your contracts, you'll get paid. Purchase upgrades for your weapons &amp; equipment so you can more easily defeat different types of enemies &amp; conquer the various challenges of the environments on each new world you explore. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693350/extras/1d4779ac9c18656634abf7f0557f2a9e.avif?t=1770888744\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693350/extras_big/1d4779ac9c18656634abf7f0557f2a9e.avif?t=1770888744 width=800 height=730 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story &amp; Characters:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kat has been corrupted by the evil Church of the Black Star. Your overarching goal is to track her down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693350/extras/9528da8cb17514704ea0e8d5389c0eb2.avif?t=1770888744\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693350/extras_big/9528da8cb17514704ea0e8d5389c0eb2.avif?t=1770888744 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our mission has been to create a game that is funny &amp; wholesome while still harkening back to our favorite game protagonists of the 90s. Bird puns, one-liners, &amp; zany animal characters are a staple of the experience we've created. Each level contains both unique &amp; mainstay enemies to keep you in the rhythm, but on your toes. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1693350?t=1770888744","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1693350?t=1770888744","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693350/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770888744","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693350/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770888744","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693350/extras/b66714a9ec12adbd3a850cc66bedd20c.avif?t=1770888744\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693350/extras_big/b66714a9ec12adbd3a850cc66bedd20c.avif?t=1770888744 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore 8 Unique Worlds:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 8 wildly different environments throughout the solar system in search of your ex-girlfriend, Kat. Revisit them with better equipment to uncover things you might've missed before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693350/extras/c40dd9a7f635a3b8dd2e85e6df3da98e.avif?t=1770888744\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693350/extras_big/c40dd9a7f635a3b8dd2e85e6df3da98e.avif?t=1770888744 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Weapons &amp; Equipment:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you fulfill your contracts, you'll get paid. Purchase upgrades for your weapons &amp; equipment so you can more easily defeat different types of enemies &amp; conquer the various challenges of the environments on each new world you explore. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693350/extras/1d4779ac9c18656634abf7f0557f2a9e.avif?t=1770888744\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693350/extras_big/1d4779ac9c18656634abf7f0557f2a9e.avif?t=1770888744 width=800 height=730 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story &amp; Characters:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kat has been corrupted by the evil Church of the Black Star. Your overarching goal is to track her down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693350/extras/9528da8cb17514704ea0e8d5389c0eb2.avif?t=1770888744\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693350/extras_big/9528da8cb17514704ea0e8d5389c0eb2.avif?t=1770888744 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our mission has been to create a game that is funny &amp; wholesome while still harkening back to our favorite game protagonists of the 90s. Bird puns, one-liners, &amp; zany animal characters are a staple of the experience we've created. Each level contains both unique &amp; mainstay enemies to keep you in the rhythm, but on your toes. </p>","developers":["In The Keep Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693350/header.jpg?t=1770888744","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> glibc 2.16+, 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.4 GHz Dual-Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Anything capable of running OpenGL 4.0 (eg. ATI Radeon HD 57xx or Nvidia GeForce 400 and higher)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 150 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1693350/412786791/d69c20314147b9cd4fdfc5731086b8448357f81d/1751020462/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749561429","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1693350/412786791/d69c20314147b9cd4fdfc5731086b8448357f81d/1751020462/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749561429","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1693350/412786791/d69c20314147b9cd4fdfc5731086b8448357f81d/1751020462/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749561429","id":257154913,"